desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Apex Specify Sharing Level"
	title_zh: "检测到 Apex 类未显式声明共享级别",
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-apex-specify-sharing-level"
	risk: "access-control"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Every Apex class should have an explicit sharing mode declared. Use the `with sharing` or `without sharing` keywords on a class to specify whether sharing rules must be enforced. Use the `inherited sharing` keyword on an Apex class to run the class in the sharing mode of the class that called it.

### 风险类型
访问控制缺陷（access-control）

### 影响
资源或接口的访问权限设置不当，可能允许越权访问。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-284: Improper Access Control
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
按最小权限原则配置访问控制，并验证所有请求的授权状态。

推荐修复：
Use the `with sharing` or `without sharing` keywords on a class to specify whether sharing rules must be enforced.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.cls": <<<POS
public class ExampleController {
}
POS
	"safefile://neg.cls": <<<NEG
public with sharing class ExampleController {
}
NEG
)

${*.cls}.pattern_regex_not(/(?:private|public|global)[\s\S]*?\sclass\s[\s\S]*?\{/, /(?:private|public|global)[\s\S]*?\b(?:with|without|inherited)\s+sharing\b[\s\S]*?\sclass\s[\s\S]*?\{/, /(?:private|public|global)[\s\S]*?\sclass\s[\s\S]*?\bextends\s+Exception\b[\s\S]*?\{/) as $p0
${*.apex}.pattern_regex_not(/(?:private|public|global)[\s\S]*?\sclass\s[\s\S]*?\{/, /(?:private|public|global)[\s\S]*?\b(?:with|without|inherited)\s+sharing\b[\s\S]*?\sclass\s[\s\S]*?\{/, /(?:private|public|global)[\s\S]*?\sclass\s[\s\S]*?\bextends\s+Exception\b[\s\S]*?\{/) as $p1
$p0 + $p1 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Apex Specify Sharing Level",
	title_zh: "检测到 Apex 类未显式声明共享级别",
	message: "Apex class does not explicitly declare a sharing level.",
}
